+# API Specialist Review: KAN-415 (Slice 3 Epic Rollup: MCP Access, Gemini/Claude OAuth & Workload OIDC)
+
+**Ticket:** KAN-415 (`[EPIC][SLICE-3-MCP-OAUTH]`)  
